 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\n株式会社山田製作所                                           MASTER SERVICES\n中央区銀座4-5-6, 530-0001 大阪市, Japan                                  AGREEMENT\n登録番号: T5872003412198\n\n発行元                                                               請求先\n株式会社山田製作所                                                   東京精密機器株式会社\n中央区銀座4-5-6                                                      港区芝浦1-2-3\n530-0001 大阪市                                                      530-0001 大阪市\nJapan                                                                Japan\nVAT: T5872003412198\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 2026年03月15日 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween 株式会社山田製作所, with its registered office at 中央区銀座4-5-6, 大阪市 (\"Party A\"), and 東京精密機器株式会社, with\nits registered office at 港区芝浦1-2-3, 大阪市 (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    株式会社山田製作所 / 佐藤健一\nParty B    東京精密機器株式会社 / 田中太郎\nDate       2026年03月15日",
